      "id" : "ExplicitConsumerBoundary",
      "text" : "Generated object schemas do not implement graph policies. normlab.parking-motivation-proposal/v1 is a narrower optional source-extraction envelope, not an extension of eventcore instance profiles or Lean. Exact quotes and selected identifiers establish structural anchoring only, not relevance, authenticity or factual truth. Review and operator authority require separate application decisions."
