      "enforceability" : "manual",
      "extends" : "sg:Policy",
      "fqid" : "nlmot:ScopedSourceProposal",
      "id" : "ScopedSourceProposal",
      "text" : "Reuse motivcore Motive and MotivationHypothesis. Each hypothesis selects this contribution's view; a resolved actor role is reached from that view, not from the quote speaker. An unresolved actor stays unresolved. Narrative sources alone do not authorize RecordedEvent, physical StateSnapshot or Delta creation. Unknown change is not an empty diff."
    },
    {
      "appliesTo" : [
        "nlmot:ParkingContribution"
      ],
      "enforceability" : "manual",
      "extends" : "sg:Policy",
      "fqid" : "nlmot:SeparateMotiveAndConsequence",
      "id" : "SeparateMotiveAndConsequence",
      "text" : "Any Entity may be actor, including AI, machine, community and natural phenomenon, without intention. Own change and downstream hypothesized consequence remain distinct. An omission has its own view, and any downstream effect needs a separate causal hypothesis; do not select a movement view merely to obtain a nonempty Delta. Motive proposals do not update legal findings or imply liability, permission or sanction."
    }
